    "photon_to_answer_ms": "t(final token of the answer) - t0(frame that triggered the VLM call). Same inclusions.",
    "answer_staleness_ms": "t(answer emitted) - t0(frame whose evidence backs that answer). For a cache hit this is the age of the cached scene evidence, not the age of the cache entry.",
