    "percentiles": "numpy.percentile with linear interpolation over the full population of the run (no warmup discarded unless the run config says so).",
    "energy_j": "Trapezoidal integration of NVML power samples over the measured window. 'marginal' subtracts the idle baseline measured before the workload started.",
